        "date": "2026-11-22T23:17:22Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): add --no-activate and --minimized start options\n\nA launched window always took the foreground: winit shows a visible,\nactive window with SW_SHOW, and the shell also called focus_window().\n--no-activate creates the window inactive and skips focus_window().\n--minimized also minimizes it at once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
